<title>VIETNAM: Eighteen missing after dredger sinks off Vietnam.</title>
<headline>Eighteen missing after dredger sinks off Vietnam.</headline>
<dateline>HANOI 1997-03-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eighteen people were missing after a dredger sank off the northern coast of Vietnam, a port official in Haiphong said on Saturday.</p>
<p>Eight people were rescued from the vessel, HB-01, which was bound for Ninh Binh province from Haiphong when it went down on March 19.</p>
